Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kappa Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-Sword Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,River of Retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:16.17,On Top,,0,0,0,,RIVER OF RETRIBUTION
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rhino Cycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:17.34,On Top,,0,0,0,,RHINO CYCLE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Are you running away again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you! Give me back my Shusui!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard's wounded but not giving up...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.95,0:02:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, if I follow these blood stains...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my sword now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, where did he go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Its Name is Enma!\NOden's Great Swords!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai went after the giant warrior-monk...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who that warrior-monk is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.76,0:03:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Kawamatsu,\NI am so glad that you are alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so grateful that you care about me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.73,0:04:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.11,0:04:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Kaido... He is still tenaciously hunting for\Nthe remnants!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been beaten...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fill him with bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kappa Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yorikiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.93,0:04:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,--Kawamatsu!\N--Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu... Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,More enemies may be on the way.\NLet's get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You are right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on! It is hard to walk here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! I am no child, Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.22,0:05:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well adults do not get all pouty like blowfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. How could you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This really brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe\Nthat I get to walk with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There is so much I want to talk to you about,\Nbut first, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,After you disappeared,\NI made my way here on mundane business...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as with the neighboring Hakumai,\Nthis northern region of Ringo,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:38.46,On Top,,0,0,0,,RINGO\NHAKUMAI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,was governed by the Shimotsuki Clan,\Nthat was famous for their toughness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.01,0:05:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Daimyo's name was Shimotsuki Ushimaru-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a master swordsman\Nwho was always seen in the company of a fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A fox?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However, just like other regions,\NRingo was destroyed by Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, do you know\NRingo's tradition of Eternal Graves?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard corpses are placed in caskets\Nand they don't decompose for centuries due to the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.53,0:06:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct.\NAnd grave markers are supposed to be swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,People in Ringo are given swords\Nwhen they are born.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.51,0:06:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They will grow up with them\Nand keep them into old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.97,0:06:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,When they die, the swords they carried\Nbecome their grave markers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The people are with their swords for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why those graves are called\Nthe Eternal Graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But since some of them are known as great swords,\Ngraverobbing is a continual problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That is how this region, Ringo, is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you what happened\Nwhen I came here 13 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was determined that if I cut my belly,\NI would do it in this region...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.55,0:07:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! Is it a monster?!\NHow creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get the weapons next time! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.77,0:07:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the curse of the samurai from Ringo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How annoying!\NWhy can't they let me die in peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I have met you once before!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Onimaru, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The name of that Koma Fox was Onimaru.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was a companion of Shimotsuki Ushimaru-{\i0}sama{\i1},\Nthe late Daimyo of Ringo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.87,0:08:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been protecting this all by yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:28.18,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For more than five years\Nsince Ringo was destroyed,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:32.80,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Onimaru had been fighting by himself against grave robbers who came to steal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:34.88,Italics,,0,0,0,,weapons from the Eternal Graves.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. You do not have to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You are injured...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is your food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Foxes like fried tofu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the matter?\NIf you do not eat, that wound will not heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you die,\Nyou cannot guard your master's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have a stomachache.\NI think I ate too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It does not matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.67,0:09:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru! Do not make a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me! I know what you want to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I explain it to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not want to disturb the sleep of the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must do this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.23,0:11:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Toki-sama, it's dangerous here!\NLet's get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I will stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Toki-sama! We will protect you\Nas long as we breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave... to the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,People can never go back to the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can go forward into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,13 years from now,\Nthere will be a big battle again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen! I am sure that there will be a day\Nwhen samurai across the country stand up in high spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When that happens,\Nwe will definitely need tons of swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,On the battlefield, we will pick up the swords of\Nour comrades who die in front of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...and advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The spirits living in those swords will make samurai stronger\Nand better able to defeat enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is still a battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Onimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle between the Animal Kingdom Pirates\Nand the Land of Wano is not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is still too early to lay these swords to rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.62,0:13:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Until that day comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we cannot let those robbers have the swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I will collect all of them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and hide them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.23,0:13:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...this is the only role...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.69,0:13:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...that I have been given!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I could not protect Hiyori-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.01,0:14:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,...this is the least I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to keep myself busy with something\Nor remorse will torment and kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,bite off this arm already and take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not stop robbing tombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:01.69,On Top,,0,0,0,,SHIMOTSUKI USHIMARU
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.01,0:15:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What has gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you understand what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Onimaru! I will join you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thus, Onimaru and I\Njoined forces to protect the graves{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and collect the swords.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Another day to rob the graves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It is freezing today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.72,0:16:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If it goes on like this,\Nwe will have no place to sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dig a hole to hide them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If I sell one or two of those swords in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I will earn money\Nto buy enough food for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I am just joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,An army marches on its stomach....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is for the greater good! Forgive me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I am back, Onimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I got some food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is your favorite, fried tofu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a money-making opportunity\Nin a place like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingoh, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.49,0:17:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I checked up on it.\NThe Eternal Graves are a treasure-trove!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can steal as many swords as we like. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Across that bridge is the main part of Ringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave, you robbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lowlifes like you cannot have any sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,--Screw you! Let's do it, Bungoh, Bongoh!\N--Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, you bastard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know my name?\NLet's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...Bandit's Bridge's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...Gyukimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, leave your weapons and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyukimaru?! Is it a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That warrior-monk has the same name...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.14,0:18:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And a short time later, I went to the capital\Nto get food,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but for a certain reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I was not able to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:01.93,On Top,,0,0,0,,FRIED-TOFU
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.09,0:19:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}People of the capital, I am sorry...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,--You're under arrest!\N--You're under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.11,0:19:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We caught him! You fried-tofu robber!\NStop resisting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the gravest blunder of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Onimaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you were held captive\Nfor 13 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a complete failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you came here to see that fox today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am sure that Onimaru must have given up on me\Nsince I never returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.15,0:19:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been 13 years already...\NI do not think he is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Zorojuro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to that warrior-monk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.61,0:20:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He opened this door and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He opened the door?\NThis place is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.53,0:20:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.09,0:20:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not tell me that is the path to the underground space\Nthat we created...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Clank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Is that Kin'emon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.23,0:20:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kawamatsu!\NI am glad that you are alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a lot to catch up on,\Nbut I need to tell you something first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You know that we conquered Udon, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.01,0:20:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I has told by Raizo that thanks to Luffytaro-dono,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the number of soldiers on our side was increased.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I bet you do not have enough swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That is exactly right!\NWe have been contemplating what to do about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He has been taking away people's swords\Nall across the country for the last 20 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought so...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But do not worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.35,0:21:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you get thousands of soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.23,0:21:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can provide as many swords as you need!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?! Truly?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Send some people\Nto the location I am about to share with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right! I will do so immediately!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.91,0:21:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Clank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But how...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Onimaru did this?\NBut only humans can do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.18,0:21:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I fulfilled... my duty...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.53,0:22:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like there are enough weapons for the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.43,0:22:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what's left to do is\Nto take back my Shusui...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.75,0:22:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard... Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Zorojuro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.13,0:22:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If your sword is the real Shusui,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,give it back to the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you! That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.22,0:22:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you a replacement!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.10,0:22:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword that was handed down to me\Nfrom my late father...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Enma the famed blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.11,0:22:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Enma...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a legendary sword\Nand the only weapon that ever injured Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.17,0:23:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give it to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The blade that cut Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.17,0:23:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Enma...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.60,0:23:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the battle of the Emperors,\NKaido and Big Mom!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.48,0:23:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While it rages to unexpected levels,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.24,0:23:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apoo of the Worst Generation and the Numbers,\Na group of giant creatures, arrive in Wano!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.86,0:23:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Another strong one joins Kaido's invincible army,\Nputting Luffy and his clan in a tighter spot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.49,0:23:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"A New Alliance?! Kaido's Army Gathers!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.59,0:23:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.59,0:23:48.59,On Top,,0,0,0,,
